find packages/storybook/src/stories -name "*.mdx" -exec grep -l "<[0-9]" {} \;
find packages/storybook/src/stories -name "*.mdx" -exec grep -l "\*\*.*%.*\*\*" {} \;

# Build test
cd packages/storybook && npm run build-storybook
```

This comprehensive update ensures Storybook stories are built with proper Stencil component understanding, correct property binding, functional icon display, and error-free MDX syntax.

